    {
      "text": "he that hath no money, come buy and eat, 2 Ne. 9:50 (Isa. 55:1). do not spend money for no worth, 2 Ne. 9:51. buy milk and honey without money, 2 Ne. 26:25. if laborers in Zion labor for money, they shall perish, 2 Ne. 26:31. Saints are persecuted because they impart word of God without money, Alma 1:20. Nephite money system, Alma 11:4–19. judges stir up people to disturbances, that they might get money, Alma 11:20. wicked go unpunished because of their money, Hel. 7:5. Nephi2 is offered money to reveal murderer, Hel. 9:20. ye shall be redeemed without money, 3 Ne. 20:38. churches shall say, For your money you shall be forgiven of sins, Morm. 8:32. ye love money more than poor, Morm. 8:37.",
